# ==============================================================================
# Patwatoli Textile ERP — Architecture Environment Reference
# ==============================================================================
# The system uses decoupled environment configurations for cloud deployment:
#
# 1. BACKEND (Render / Railway / Cloud Go API):
#    - Template file: backend/.env.example
#    - Local dev file: backend/.env.local (Safe, points to local Docker DB)
#
# 2. FRONTEND (Vercel / Cloudflare Next.js):
#    - Template file: frontend/.env.example
#    - Local dev file: frontend/.env.local (Safe, points to http://localhost:8080/api/v1)
# ==============================================================================

# Quick Local Reference:
# ---------------------
# Backend Port: 8080
# Backend Local DB: postgres://erp_user:erp_password@localhost:5432/textile_erp?sslmode=disable
# Frontend Port: 3000
# Frontend API URL: http://localhost:8080/api/v1
